  title: Indian National Army
  text: The Indian National Army was formed in South-East Asia in 1942 with Japanese support and revived by Subhas Chandra Bose in 1943, with the slogan Delhi Chalo. The INA trials at the Red Fort in 1945 and 1946 stirred nationwide support.
